    "text": "wcyb.com\nwebsite\nKingsport\nProposed legislation aims to limit PBM influence and preserve independent pharmacies\nBy Yannia Nordelo,\n7 hours agoKINGSPORT, Tenn. (WCYB) — Pharmacy Benefit Managers or PBMs are the middlemen who control what you pay at the counter when you pick up your prescriptions which oftentimes leads local pharmacies like Barry’s Pharmacy to lose hundreds of dollars but now a Tennessee lawmaker is proposing legislation to help control that and give more power back to local pharmacies and customers.\n1",
